    "text": "Let the tangent drawn to the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. Then the normal to the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;does NOT pass through the point:",
